file tools/co/comment_citation_witness.rish three assertions for those cases, one for the printed scope, and its recited behavior count moved fourteen to seventeen
file tools/fixtures/l/living_docs_lint_scan.sh duty 6 walks the docs roster union the seated pin roster, names each page's own bound and headroom, and prints both lists rather than one beneath the other
