file construction/archive/20260831-090000_itinerary-settled-decisions.md the fourth shelf: the landed arcs, the panchanga, the fusion build
file context/specs/20260724-132812_pin-and-ledger-living-pin-max-bytes.md the law names the union it governs, since one roster and one bound reading is the whole of it
